Anyway, the class idea is an elementalist.

He converts the elements around him into spells, rather than reading
from books. He converts fire into fireballs, or combines them with air
to make lightning bolts. An air elemental very quickly becomes a
source of air energy for the elementalist. To do so requires Manna but
that's just par for the course really.


